{
  "id": "JDG.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Abayaasii 2",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Malaika wOMWAMI yalolekha eBokhimu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana malaika OMWAMI narula eGiligali, natikulukha niyoola eBokhimu. Naboola mbu Ndamutikulusia nimurusia muMisiri, nimuusia mushialo eshia ndeetsubila abakuuka beenywe mbu ndakhabaheelesiai nimboola mbu Shindaloonoonia indakano yanje nineenywe nahatuutu ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neenyu, murakholakhwo indakano yosi nabamenya mushialo shino ta; mulikulule ebimalilo biabwe. Nebutswa shimwahuliile amakhuwa kanje ta. Kho mubeele murie? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho bulaano emboola mbu Shindalabeelusia imbeliwo ta; ne balamubeelanga shinga amahwa mumbafu, ne abanyasaye babwe balamubeelanga omubero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa malaika wOMWAMI yaboolela abaana baIsiraeli bosi amakhuwa ako, abandu bakhupa tsimbungu nibalila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibakulikha habundu tsana eliira mbu Bokhimu; nibamumalila OMWAMI emisango ebweneyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhufwa khwaYoswa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Yoswa yali naseebuule abandu, abaana baIsiraeli batsia buli mundu mubulaamebwe okhulia eshialo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abandu nibakhalabanila OMWAMI tsindaalo tsiosi tsiaYoswa, netsindaalo tsiosi tsiabakofu abaYoswa yalekha, abali nibalola ebikhole biosi ebikhongo biOMWAMI ebia yakholela Isiraeii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoswa waNuni, omusumba wOMWAMI, nafwa, nali owemiyika eshikhumi nende ekhumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibamuyabila mwiloba liobulaamebwe eTiminatsi-heresi, mushialo shiebikulu shiaFfuraimu, enotsi weshikulu shiaGaashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abolubaka olwo lwosi balonda abandu babwe; abolubaka lundi nibabuukha inyuma wabwe, abaramumanya OMWAMI kata ebikhole ebia yali niyakholela Isiraeli ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "AbaIsiraeli bakalukha inyuma mukhulonda khuMwami.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abaana baIsiraeli bakhola akali amabii mumoni tsiOMWAMI, nibakhalabanila emiBaali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibalekha OMWAMI, Nyasaye wabakuuka babwe, owabarusia mushibala shialvlisiri, nibalonda khubanyasaye bandi, abokhubanyasaye babandu abababotokhana, nibabeenamila, nibasinyisia OMWAMI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibalekha OMWAMI, nibakhalabanila Baali nemiAshitarotsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburima bwOMWAMI nibwashila Isiraeli, naye nabahaana mumikhono chiabayaayi ababayaaya; nabakusia mumikhono chiabasuku ababotokhanayo; nibaranyala okhusinjila imbeli wabasuku babwe khandi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ewa basamulilanga okhutsia hosi hosi, omukhono kwOMWAMI kwabafukulanga nikuleera obubii, shinga OMWAMI olwa yali niyaboola, khandi shinga OMWAMI olwa yali niyabeetsubila; nibaba mumatinyu muno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obukhalabani bwabayaasii",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI nasinjisia abayaasii, ababahonia mumakhono ka abo ababayaayanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa shibahulilanga abayaasii babwe ta; okhuba bakhola obuheyi bwokhulonda khubanyasaye bandi, nibabeenamila; bakotola bwangu, nibarula khunjila etsia abakuuka babwe balondanga nibahulilanga amalako kOMWAMI; nabo nibarakhola bario ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli olwa OMWAMI yabasinjisilinjia omuyaasii, OMWAMI omwene yabeetsangaho nomuyaasii oyo, nabahonia mumakhono kabasuku babwe tsindaalo tsiosi tsiomuyaasii tsana, okhuba OMWAMI yabatiililwa eshisa khulwa okhubinda khwabwe khulwabo ababamiinanga nibabanyasia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne buli olwa omuyaasii owalinjiho yafwitsanga, bakalukhanga inyuma, nibeeyoonoonia okhushila abakuuka babwe, nibalonda khubanyasaye bandi, nibabakhalabanila nibabeenamila; kata shibalekhakhwo ebiima ebio, kata injila yabwe ikhayikhanu, ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oburima bwOMWAMI nibwashila Isiraeli; naboola mbu Shichila abelihanga lino bakhayile indakano yanje eya ndalaka abakuuka babwe, nibarahulila amakhuwa kanje ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niko akachila nasi shindaleelusinjia imbeli wabwe lihanga liosi khu ako aka Yoswa yalekha olwa yafwa ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu endeeme Isiraeli ninako, nibaba nibeetsa okhulinda injila yOMWAMI nibachendakhwo, shinga abakuuka babwe olwa bachilinda, nohomba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho OMWAMI yalekha amahanga ako, oburakeelusia bwangu ta; kata shiyabahaana mumukhono kwaYoswa tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
